{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1185,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:243cf141b5b93cf04c476360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶嘿嘿，看着像城里的赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd436bda1f21b3dde92fefbcaaeb78d7eb9846846db2ea061e3838e82530b79f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37e91f0989a8d4c009d4e3fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是可爱的衣服呐～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36df99cff42cd89f938266c86df60477a7b180420f47d295dd9437477dd55b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2d2746efb0b194554a71e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？能成为人气第1吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f1e5078d71c8b10409352c8f1871a0173d7b1d678ea79d8ae7f0f94c71b1d67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a84b5c2c4af4bbf03a004ac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然能穿着这么可爱的泳装什么的…\r\n诶嘿嘿，好害羞啊♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "616933e5dbc9b50a9e6449f1d27bd976cfda51c3dfa1925bdb0bfd56b356b661",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f01545ee37f4864931fbb94d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "光是看着就好像能闻到\r\n太阳的味道呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "86b512dc6e8505623d437c4bd771664596dc8d2ca02e8529186bb3d321464e2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c50c49e1ca4b1030325b8e8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好厉害啊～……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a35cc1a1f563cceb56e50e212087077488890e63d45a72418e3f5b7376f0de6f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a4f20c1c07503e8bd684eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会成为日本第一的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5d5096ba1f970d465976c240b11c7dcd2c5505ea1b652bc7d25fdc9e5c579ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afd8d8210c0c98336960de87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很帅气吧？\r\n为了不输给这身可要好好端正仪态了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bb1164d0638850326a16f0fc72e10cfba1000f272af4fb9d208ec7cbed105f9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d10c26447ac7917a9d509c07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到自己穿着这件背负着大家思念的决胜服，\r\n就会感到十分的自豪。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45544f907ac2727e06c202f9c9453566aebfac615430608c1ad882a49a49ac4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "71217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e43827e20416d1cf0b846586",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaca00030584d29f8ecc72a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很期待比赛呢！\r\n全力以赴地上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b51e043475b1ed63d094f079648c97cad537e7931b47d041289524b75cfd938b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6364d2e37b258325722d57a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为日本第一是我的梦想！\r\n不会把胜利让给任何人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46cea6efef4fe9cf173fed76f245c415790f9fbd1421a8ed8d719407bfc887b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45ac695807ad6e6eadb87e4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n今天也请多多指教，\r\n训练员！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0938ae98e513e924a0ac0cb5b8b359a0f5b2477f04d0635c61cecdd28195097",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f91d6c6551e923d142feaec3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以日本第一的赛马娘为目标！\r\n今天也要加油～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7a6b3b3eaaed80c4d2154c872af019aadf56d59a092ecf7f06f8adc2975506",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca90f52307ef4977703cb246",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你好，训练员～！\r\n午后的训练也一起加油吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b06a5be8f909c3bfa376b3cfe82e593382ad113b978941060a43ddd59098675",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be6612054f29c4647e945eb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "久等了～！\r\n中午也吃了饱饱的了，\r\n现在就尽情活动身体吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac1b181dbf520cdedb1301f24d14d3524ad314a6c10e675722d30c270b4282e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67e6006a14c7555b79a48760",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠～…啊！？\r\n没、没睡哦，我没睡哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca309245d967d45c9e5d59aeac8d74c6c824ae155df044af813abd0fcbe9a93c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4956c91c9fb95b8ee8e1a22a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天一整天也辛苦了，\r\n差不多也该准备睡觉了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21eb3f0a6f0d631fcc252f4d5714735b6746b44ef78f0671fc89cba9308115c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab368d37acf0d3ce8cc3b922",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近开始暖和起来了呢！\r\n下次休息的时候，要不要去稍微\r\n远些的地方散步吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec83a8ae75338c7b67e83aa204efb6a2313a84d1c025dd1d617b1483c05b204",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9307b0c99ae387ea84b559d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜诶、今天也好热啊…\r\n要注意不要吃太多冰淇淋才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "68268c330985277b1ea9e8a3b72945fdd189d2519318eab8b172a525987de519",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d12a18dd2d837f67ea7fc652",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，是训练员！刚刚\r\n看到了卖石烤番薯的摊子！\r\n这次一定得吃到才行…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8031c52cf4b5769b8ae59b07edf84cfb9e99f3f62042b0d9ff8dc69ea7d3ff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8b6865af9e602598bc0edba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员！从朋友那里\r\n拿到了暖宝宝…\r\n不介意的话要拿一个吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cc0017b78ec6fd0ddada0af037a4b02f140721d99c7f068c9688815b9af29a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e32df6818466bd15abb5df9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！呼～。\r\n全身都沐浴在晨风中，\r\n真舒服啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75b893d8dcae45f53cc2a5b265264af883f467f8a4795f41b2840c733efb3e53",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1faa12573d44a3a79e37983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上游泳的感觉\r\n真好啊～♪在北海道的话，\r\n早泳就没那么容易了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b39da688c33914482e05df805b6bf50cb309d1aff3e5119841643cee66e8428",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6e5124d66f79cc7257fd501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午安，训练员！\r\n不知道饭后能不能游泳？\r\n中午吃的稍微有点太多了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "11789c8bd7d6b3f7cf50adf24b6d753c2bb6ad655df0bed2a299cbbd363d0e13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e0ec96459eee67f5761ec7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天还剩下半天！\r\n那么就再游一圈…\r\n啊不对，再加把劲～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c9f1a076a179fecbbd49e50db957c6f6277231c2eff90d94b67484f8d5f2eb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65302c42e98234153bad0b6c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "工作累了的话就在\r\n泳池里飘一会吧！\r\n能够放松精神，真是太棒了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0364970b5ef8e7120fa711c1bbffde753b5989b041fba31fa5556c59f5f5add",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385e1787fdc4ec657d3adca8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "晚上好！夜里真冷呢ー。\r\n这种时候就要注意保暖，小心不要\r\n感mao…阿嚏！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "29abf2f7e9ef4f072f4c3300d1bd74d106ed213c6a891bed5ea662061f509443",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f510eacb2c24d293248194e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春天是开始的季节！\r\n要一起去游泳吗？\r\n诶…一般来说是夏天？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d08734c373101bbf859239d79428d6615ca78891c8ed123a61e10e8bdcec7248",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:389ef241fd02dbe141a46aea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "终于来了呢，泳装的季节！和平常\r\n完全不同的“特别”的我，\r\n就好好看着吧～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d947dbf128767ef9b222500cde64c810ccd5882013a13f731a1e68610c86eba3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f082926c4a15bfedbb949f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的肚子，很正常对吧？\r\n也就只吃了3个烤番薯而已，\r\n一定没问题的…！没问题吧…",
      "source_fingerprint": "a45f1cea4d70fb4c6d3989a9aa57cc2f8c8bde527fa4665b76251b1b7b990f22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:571c4d33326eec65126452a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到冬天那就是冬泳…\r\n但水里太冷了，\r\n所以果然还是加油冬跑吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "21e176812a2e72c5bff12b21142d1c84c353476987b8ce2e9999d144f66ee80c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d254015995fceff54def4a89",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f46c0e5751549c549413ec0b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:96cb7310cb7e4f6f5672ef2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早上好！\r\n为了能承载着大家的梦想，\r\n今天也要加油了哦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "af75424cbea3f4eff40ed809a5113a9e3c8310c21d50f6aa1bb80431a6c582e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2c60a18060510c6723e4648",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的我，气势可是日本第一的哦！\r\n因为早餐我吃了纳豆拌饭、烤鱼、味增汤和鸡蛋烧……\r\n还有其他很多很多好吃的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc0026f23c0e8440f3301d45d51bc183ee592b808f5474f062735b31980acf22",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b505228dd2ed0a13642e1fc2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一整天才过去了一半！\r\n用德比来说的话就是才到1200m！\r\n下午也一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a493729e0217fd5f3c71e1855ac2c36cca2a6f8dcc4ece32f40101a0a594653",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02d467ba74f0d8d9f0d4312e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔～……如果是日本第一的赛马娘的话，\r\n就不能输给困意呢……\r\n下午的课程也要……好好地……哈欠～",
      "source_fingerprint": "40466a4c33ba0b8100225093181f2096b266c2bf09b2bdb3dc9aa777435bc646",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90213"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9c4dfcb2d9f5557f4d7821c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要吃点夜宵？\r\n我做了些饭团哦。\r\n鲑鱼和海带的组合可是最强的哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3130ca7a9fed435cf89ed78d656cbe5706b243f5b0db1c0cc4b4392aa8ed993",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90214"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc726dc1cc291c93a10d512f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好好休息也是很重要的呢！\r\n我很推荐在睡前咕咚咕咚地喝些\r\n暖暖的热牛奶哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea73abb758e990c83e31c56879762ae07bd286c4d098f4487f67443c70569fe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90215"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4755350e97eec508b5b58fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冰雪消融，春天的花朵也就开始绽放了呢～\r\n我也不能服输，要继续努力成长才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31f2083f2fcd877a8c4ad9d32c4b576f018c38d97efa088db576130a9cfd05ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:454b2bbc113db0f56ae68e42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在水果店里摆放的一堆西瓜里，\r\n有着一个很有“总大将”感觉的大西瓜哦！\r\n真想尝尝看啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f7a9c6e5792f2639c0470f23268e40b548a684cc7a7af06ebb3c23074a438849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ed736199c506eb911055bc1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天到了哦，食欲之秋！\r\n跑步的力气和食欲都高涨起来了，\r\n要吃得饱饱的，然后跑个痛快了哟～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "713b7a389dd375e39167b70ec2f516d701937ff2e1ad384c22d517355f02f8bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7c0b02d4965a20959949c5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为我已经习惯了冬天上冻的路面了，\r\n所以就让我来领头吧！\r\n还请抓紧我的手哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8acee157a24de308935465f63ae4c9fcf66e72291d03ac167270f06f654fb671",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43df100d2cc8bd2cb99d80c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "90221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4588e6096f8147846e4ba6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚我和丸善小姐\r\n搭上话了！\r\n果然是位优秀的人呢～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce7cd271f9f80d1a310699d14ba8bc7c90fdd3997ebf7b222ca07ba8bbcf640e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6874319185a2d7ed31dfef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从妈妈那里收到了很多\r\n蔬菜哦！\r\n这次也分点给训练员你吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fca91f32e332c53536ada29022a0160fc5ef5a8cf753ef1a56442fd264163e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:64ac5cb4383b3a350328de96",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈欠…昨天一不小心就和\r\n铃鹿同学聊天聊到半夜了…\r\n诶嘿嘿，真开心啊～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7469f25069887b3bbe261a7bcc0b6c872a4781028a8c4d166bb9dc40af9d6be6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f5956d669307648f3666468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一想到饭堂的东西都很好吃，\r\n就会一不注意就吃很多呢～。\r\n诶嘿嘿…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cc8b815732e06b359ed6f94e4e4bff7d5221185ab634767a3319bfd4e9efd5a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b05bdeb22da61d886bd94ff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园真的很大呢。\r\n我说不定不久后\r\n就会在学园里遇难了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87bb238339712c3b047a64bb46f10fe87adbfe805a02f4eb28f39e14aa2e4fab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:accf33884c2ce4ff6565d7fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚刚居然有后辈跑过来\r\n对我说『我是你的粉丝！』什么的！\r\n哈哇哇…没想到会有这种事呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2c387a01f1c6709b1c23c9ce97da9fa590e1825ca7d23337ca1527bc027862a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ee0c285e8c47a7b89ae443",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要一穿上这套衣服，身体\r\n都轻快了起来！感觉就这样\r\n跑回北海道也没有问题…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5302dd732d5afd41d8fde06403ae4840effe13d4305627928c1045610e88748",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f77acc237c16c1b4e2c51b01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直至这件衣服成为日本\r\n第一的证明为止…！\r\n我都想继续奔跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "62ead5cfa90ac9085a5afaf0166489c72ae22990beae6ee476d2fb626726d55a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fc484ad8083d6f44736cc8b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给妈妈发了穿着决胜服的\r\n照片后马上就打电话过来了！\r\n嘿嘿…电话那头“哇哇！”地嚎啕大哭呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da52b46e17a6416a38a17ede60e28ff4b8e998a27c5e2c4334640e07c928eecc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c546fc6afe2da2854191be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早和小鹰她们一起\r\n晨练了哦！\r\n诶嘿嘿！感觉很清爽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52a33bbc9852e0758869fa234af3aaaedb7ec1cfdd9938a8586987dd9c59677e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8dd9b80c557e2fbb016e6fea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…上午上课的随堂小测\r\n没有及格～…！\r\n这下又要去请教小草了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5fd8fc5a27ad293a04a9956a6bce5658bd0c95d53260523f59863f1ea5cb05e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eff8cc1a9a0f47c7dcdfcb74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为什么一到晚上就会不自觉的\r\n想吃甜的东西呢…呜，\r\n胡萝卜在脑子里诱惑着我～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb62be2096e5f1882be7dfc7ce741c1994de20e78ce3e2ebe19abb58726e84cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd8249b3df132a922e346f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿…嚏！\r\n诶，为什么最近那么容易\r\n打喷嚏呢…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "73aeaf8c2e3c7ea96c51ff7f64ada16fa36ef65283de9a67580fd01a3077e6b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a52d731c6c66bf0ca873249",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗅嗅…咦，雨的味道…？\r\n这可真是能够缓解酷暑的\r\n恩惠之雨呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b450336513ff2f99b31a2bcf7922da279546bb37ed098b6d8c5cf802ce14518",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cac97351e32ac571c07e4bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到秋天就总有种\r\n寂寞的感觉呢。\r\n不知道妈妈身体还好吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d2656e14dfb135d40c39d957e2fc184862262278971a4ce4d433b6b20a03226",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af35f6a528c45f6e458f6b55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜…我可不会输给内地的冬天！\r\n虽然是这么想的，\r\n但、但该冷的还是会冷啊～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41bec19f50006091e996bb6c3b5547a84ba3a5308816039cb27b2168ef18a6e6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cfa8ca1d245b8fb1931dfff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "铃鹿同学不管是跑步还是游泳\r\n都很快呢…无论哪个方面我都得\r\n努力追上她才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "719c79a002a86ea3ec9c314bbda4967f46384d7dafaf050f4b3aa1b8a53ecbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adff7a97c21a73a9b479341e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "被小鹰叫去摔跤了…\r\n明明这又不是摔跤服～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df8d492ac91b8867b56358dc4259de328c101ac51872d628cee5fe96f1d90f93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adea7df4d250672d8fb81050",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次请丸善小姐来给我做\r\n舞蹈特训了！\r\n目标是领奖台的第1名！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdbdc456fbb39211f7d0b1a516f1414c65e1041fcfbe604a6e76fc9928433a39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfde4fbea9aac172185f17a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呜，如果不注意的话…\r\n青酱就会乘机跑过来\r\n戳我的背～…",
      "source_fingerprint": "b56836686fc2c545a44ed47947831679936df84c9cab5ee476e2687750d76f44",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e8a07cc72f0ec5d3381b52e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给妈妈发了穿着泳装的照片之后\r\n…寄来的胡萝卜就变少了…",
      "source_fingerprint": "05688210a158d9d10db21631203b2e8b22b2950cfc5cea37359823a38d8a9988",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c15110e879ed2fe7ef2996b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起床后立刻去游泳的话\r\n就会特别清醒！\r\n有机会的话训练员也请尝试一下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f02d0adf904b7875e7e193081659b3001beae9eaf67f04a86cccacee6048b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47421a7aa08b0176ebcbd68d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光好刺眼～…！\r\n如果不涂防晒霜的话…\r\n会被晒伤的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c857379bcfd4b124cf18cb0dd758f1e0c2016fcdd2505f587198d8e58bdcb406",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1160b27e0fd58b24e5b35d24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我肚子会不会冷？\r\n放心吧！我有妈妈\r\n给我准备的腹卷！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65ccdd268ca83992b37de45ddd5731f84a6c627241c2c6e4c5df3e27f4e7fdc2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a748f7a6f436c36eeaaeadac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一边游泳一边赏花…\r\n同时也可以起到锻炼的作用，\r\n我觉得很不错！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64fb85cf7e4b832e3ce5a54fdab224595f96af296daa49db959dfa881cfb4d58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f64f17ccacd618d536a99f33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "泳池也好烟花也好夏日\r\n祭典也好…！为了让这个夏天\r\n不留遗憾，全都好好享受吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b30c824cdf0afd3cf28879d543ef89085ef6bc27bd7ba1303fa88c59ada9c0a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83a48e16ddf50d4e3aa733f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "团子、烤番薯、南瓜布丁…\r\n不行，不忍住的话！\r\n因为这件衣服，肚子会很明显…",
      "source_fingerprint": "16c6d70a8fab63f35ea965f5aee5ded3c7492f0783259be25cc04ecec924d820",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e41d19903ddb0469f88e17f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本来以为已经习惯了，但穿成\r\n这样果然还是有点…阿嚏！\r\n还是有点冷啊…",
      "source_fingerprint": "4285a5aa5657e561986b029f98f75f4fb64ce43a7db0eb14f18b8e2c66a906a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43e610cdf3d4678e55517e59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时何地都要全力以赴！\r\n尽情享受跑步游泳的\r\n乐趣吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7c2e07e820350fbd89333732bfa18384ddd13dd2754b3828321f9a75edc8d39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4283116a7aa5e29114bc8d62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要穿着它心情\r\n就像在放暑假一样！这样就能好好\r\n享受度假的气氛了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca006e4531702971d559ea5e6178db4aa34f2496c093e5bf4a70191112ae8057",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a474a356230f3158c29b877f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然可能只有一点点，\r\n但是我也有向着“能够自豪地站在妈妈们面前的赛马娘”的目标\r\n稍微接近了些吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "08e5c0f01e804e344f94bcc94f346ee307c224730163aae287963a5ef5e576f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed50aa4c54bc92abdbe7a980",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“这件决胜服好像很适合拿着\r\n刀剑呢”，小草她这么说了哦……\r\n也就是很帅气的意思对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb19d219ee8e7c89108e837e2ffa58202defa97c8a4b2b3815b484b07679a60f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54513401d61e87f04945785f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "鹤丸她虽然伤病不断，\r\n但是一直都开朗地拼命努力着……\r\n我可不能输给她啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "486907499354ceaf411a7235b3f26e0bbd47ee32f0461c61b98b229b9fa1b6e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6738a9c8722f34a2882dcc69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "职业摔跤比赛真厉害呀～！\r\n在这之后就因为和小鹰聊上头\r\n错过了宿舍的门禁时间呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "549c94c6c7c9ee98f2c7b1f917a1785301bed6f9475b1dfee03ef4c31efc34a4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91219"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1333e492b8482e35c28151ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "之前偶然看到了数码同学笔记本里的\r\n内容，居然连关于我的报道\r\n都被她做成了剪报……好高兴啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e016d2c41ba1e5147cf67c2561ef4d4fccb7884caa06da3987fab2a0f2e3fc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1001",
        "91220"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
